# MonsterSprites: Laphkal Pixel Fantasy Monsters Pack, converted to
# code so the project stays plain text and pushable (no PNGs).
# Each monster's 16 frames (64x64 in the pack) are downscaled to
# 32x32 (the size monsters display at) and quantized to one shared
# 64-colour palette per monster. Frames 1-4 = idle, 5-12 = walk,
# 13-16 = attack (all face right; monster.gd flips horizontally).
# '.' is transparent; other characters index the palette
# (charset A-Za-z0-9+/). Credit: monsters by Laphkal.
# Unused pack monsters (dark_acolyte, ghost_wisp, giant_spider,
# imp, orc_brute) are not in this file yet — add them the same way.
